[SWS_DM_01028] Event status bit transitions triggered by ClearDiag- nosticInformation UDS service
⌈
If the clearing of a DTC is triggered by the UDS
service 0x14 ClearDiagnosticInformation, the DM shall reset the Event status bits
to:
• kTestFailed = 0;
• kTestFailedThisOperationCycle = 0;
• kTestNotCompletedThisOperationCycle = 1;
⌋

